  "reasoning": "The defendant assaulted the victim causing a legally defined light injury (二级轻伤), which constitutes the crime of intentional injury (故意伤害). He also forced the victim to ingest methamphetamine, which is punishable as the crime of forcing another to use drugs (强迫他人吸食、注射毒品罪). By detaining the victim in a hotel room and restricting his freedom while coercing him to sign a guarantee and a large debt note, the defendant committed illegal detention (非法拘禁罪). The use of violence and intimidation to obtain a 500,000 yuan IOU amounts to extortion (敲诈勒索罪). Therefore, the appropriate charges are intentional injury, forced drug use, illegal detention, and extortion.",
